<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="ref-hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">OPEN QUESTIONS</text>
    <text class="shell-title">未解之谜</text>
    <text class="shell-desc">课件留下但没有回答的问题。这里展示的是课程中的开放问题，不是标准答案。</text>

    <view class="filter-block">
      <text class="filter-block__label">主题</text>
      <view class="filter-chips">
        <text
          wx:for="{{themes}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="filter-chip {{activeTheme === item ? 'filter-chip--active' : ''}}"
          data-value="{{item}}"
          bindtap="selectTheme"
          aria-role="button"
          aria-label="筛选主题：{{item}}"
        >{{item}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="result-line">
      <text class="result-line__count">{{count}} 个开放问题</text>
    </view>

    <view class="question-wall">
      <view
        wx:for="{{items}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="question-card"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="openQuestion"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="打开问题：{{item.question}}"
      >
        <text class="question-card__mark" aria-hidden="true">?</text>
        <text class="question-card__kicker">{{item.kicker}} · {{item.theme}}</text>
        <text class="question-card__question">{{item.question}}</text>
        <view class="question-card__meta">
          <text>{{item.lectureText}}</text>
          <text>{{item.pageText}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty-panel">
      <text class="empty-panel__title">这个主题暂时没有条目</text>
      <text class="empty-panel__note">切回“全部”查看六个开放问题。</text>
    </view>

    <text class="copyright">“已知 / 未知 / 为什么重要”由编者据课件整理；不确定处按原文保留。</text>
  </view>
</view>
